# Text files are stored and checked out with LF everywhere, so the deterministic dataset generator
# (`python examples/make_datasets.py --check`) and the SHA-256 literals behave the same on Windows,
# macOS and Linux. Without this, core.autocrlf turns the CSVs into CRLF on checkout and the fixtures
# stop matching their generator without a single byte of real content changing.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.svg text eol=lf
